# QA M3, Stage 4 Durchkriechstein as Hackl (D-057: Zuckerschock or Hackl
# -> shed to Normal, „Ballast weg!", no points, no life). The stone comes
# before Falkenstein's H-box and the camera never scrolls back, so a
# Hackl at the stone needs a carried-over Hackl: the qa_m3_hackl_vs_rock
# run (test route `hackl falkenstein`, Falkenstein as Hackl from frame
# 2214, the rock shattered at 4038) goes on up the shaft and across the
# church plateau into the boulder's face at the mouth (col 149). DOWN
# without JUMP starts the crawl at 5219; she comes out at col 154 as
# Normal (frame ~5296, then the 30-frame freeze), lives and score as
# before the crawl.
